# Solitaire's shelves and card faces (owner, 2026-10-25; games.md 5.1).
# The wheel slides the cursor along a shelf: the top one (stock, waste,
# four foundations) left to right clockwise, then on from its right end
# to the left end of the bottom one (the seven tableau piles), like
# reading lines. Every card shows its rank top left and its suit top
# right, both in the strip a stacked card keeps showing.
# The simulator's fixed deal: 2 of diamonds (pile 3) onto the 3 of
# spades (pile 4), 9 of spades (pile 1) onto the 10 of diamonds, two
# draws, the 9 of hearts onto the 10 of clubs (pile 5), the 8 of spades
# (pile 2) onto it: pile 2 turns up the 4 of hearts. Then a run: SELECT
# on pile 4 picks up its whole face-up run (3 of spades, 2 of diamonds;
# the gold frame); over the empty pile 1 nothing fits (the cursor turns
# grey); over the 4 of hearts the run fits (blue) and SELECT drops it.
# Five more draws put the ace of clubs on the waste; a double press
# sends it home; the pause menu's Undo takes it back.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-solitaire-shelf.script
# needs: modules
# timeout: 120
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
sdk_clear            # a fresh deal (the simulator deals from a fixed seed)
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Games
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Solitaire
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot deal            # the cursor on the stock
wheel +5 500         # along the top shelf to the last foundation
wait 500
shot top_end
wheel +1 300         # past its end: the tableau's first pile
wait 500
shot bottom_start
wheel -1 300         # and back up
wait 400
wheel +3 400         # pile 3
wait 400
key SELECT           # pick up the 2 of diamonds
wait 400
wheel +1 300         # pile 4
wait 400
key SELECT           # 2 on the 3; pile 3 turns up the 10 of diamonds
wait 500
wheel -3 500         # pile 1
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 400
wheel +2 400         # pile 3
wait 400
key SELECT           # 9 of spades on the 10 of diamonds; pile 1 empty
wait 500
wheel -8 800         # the stock
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 400
key SELECT           # two draws: the 9 of hearts on top of the waste
wait 500
wheel +1 300         # the waste
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 400
wheel +9 900         # pile 5
wait 400
key SELECT           # 9 of hearts on the 10 of clubs
wait 500
wheel -3 500         # pile 2
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 400
wheel +3 500         # pile 5
wait 400
key SELECT           # 8 of spades on the 9; pile 2 turns up the 4 of hearts
wait 600
shot stacked         # a column reads card by card: rank left, suit right
wheel -1 300         # pile 4: the frame covers its run
wait 500
shot run_spot
key SELECT           # pick up the run (gold)
wait 500
shot run_held
wheel -3 500         # pile 1, empty: nothing fits (grey cursor)
wait 500
shot run_nofit
wheel +1 300         # pile 2: the 4 of hearts takes the run
wait 500
shot run_fits
key SELECT           # drop: 4, 3, 2 on pile 2; pile 4 turns a card up
wait 600
shot run_dropped
wheel -7 800         # the stock
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 400
key SELECT           # five more: the ace of clubs on the waste
wait 600
wheel +1 300         # the waste
wait 500
shot ace
key SELECT
wait 100
key SELECT           # double press: the ace to a foundation
wait 700
shot home
key MENU             # the pause menu
wait 600
wheel +2 400         # Undo
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot undone          # the ace back on the waste
quit
